{#
  The grouping `twig` generates, and nothing else (spec 6.5).

  One group per service that has a card, in service-name order. It comes from
  the installed tree and from nothing else: a widget file is copied byte for
  byte and this is not one, so the layout is a function of which services
  declare widgets and a card appearing and disappearing with its service is
  this file changing.
#}
# Generated by twig. Every card named here is a widget file some service
# declared, copied through unparsed.
groups:
{% for row in rows %}
  - name: {{ row.service }}
{% endfor %}
